  "description": "Steeped in history, this exceptional property – originally built over a century ago as a traditional Forge – seamlessly blends character with modern elegance. Tucked away on a remarkably private site, this home has been meticulously upgraded in recent years to a modern bespoke finish. Offering the rare combination of rich heritage, secluded living and contemporary sophistication, this unique home is a true sanctuary. The accommodation extends to approx. 117 sq.m. and comprises entrance hall, living room, two bedrooms, bathroom, kitchen, utility room and sunroom. ‘Rothby Forge’ is conveniently located with all amenities on your doorstep including Dublin Airport, Swords Main Street, M1 & M50 motorways. Viewing is highly recommended to experience the charm, seclusion and craftmanship of this home.\n\n*Unique home on private, secluded site with all amenities on your doorstep\n*Extensively modernised and upgraded with great care and attention to a stylish, high specification, bespoke finish\n*Sunny South and West facing gardens\n*Private, mature site c. 0.12 Hectares (0.29 Acres)\n*High vaulted ceilings\n*Bespoke built in units – entrance hall, living room and bedrooms\n*Modern, stylish handleless fitted kitchen complete with integrated appliances and feature lighting\n*Utility room\n*Triple aspect Sun room\n*Electric entrance gates lead to lengthy tree lined driveway\n*Attic insulation\n*New roof and wall plates\n*New internal doors, architraves and skirting boards\n*Optima insulation installed to all external walls – specifically designed for old cottages\n*Full re-wire of entire house\n*Full re-plumb of entire house\n*New double glazed windows and doors throughout\n*New heating system and radiators installed\n*New flooring throughout\n*Fully tiled bathroom featuring high spec fittings\n*Biocycle\n*Rural setting only minutes drive to Dublin Airport, Swords Main Street, M1 & M50 motorways\n\nEntrance Hall   -   4.9m x 2.6m\nSpacious entrance hall with 